{"title":"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) Find integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/bef747a48a2a8d43c4841e12c89f2de2502a672e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cf6ece52d6f6414c8b53ef61ec937bcbce2a4da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^3+B^4=C^5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"115\" height=\"16\" /> Express your answers in exponential form.\n</p><p>(b) Find integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/299ddf7c0f03ea46bf09f81f93adeea0756aa15c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1ce665f7e4196f5081bcade287e360b06d8f7d85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^3+B^4+C^5=3^D.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"158\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6a69a7619b685a28cfe7baaf6d4962e76101d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=2^8,B=2^6,C=2^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"179\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p>(b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/4543267b0f7ff7046c1fa1826dc0d35bff0b6289.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=3^{20},B=3^{15},C=3^{12},D=61$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"266\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II\">2010 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_I